---
layout: base.njk
title: "Always Yesterday Party"
description: "Always Yesterday Party（AYP）"
permalink: /
---
<main>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative min-h-screen flex items-center overflow-hidden">
    <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-navy via-navy/80 to-white/90"></div>
    <div aria-hidden="true" class="hero-orb absolute -top-24 left-1/2 h-64 w-64 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-orange/20 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div aria-hidden="true" class="hero-orb absolute -bottom-32 right-0 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-orange/5 blur-3xl"></div>

    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 text-center">
      <span class="hero-dot inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-orange mb-6" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-7xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
        <span class="hero-line inline-block">ALWAYS</span><br class="sm:hidden" />
        <span class="hero-line inline-block">YESTERDAY</span><br />
        <span class="hero-line inline-block">PARTY</span>
      </h1>
      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="#development" class="hero-btn inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/40 bg-white/10 px-8 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-white/20">
          Development
        </a>
        <a href="#discography" class="hero-btn inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/40 bg-white/10 px-8 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-white/20">
          Discography
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:yo@alwaysyesterday.party" class="hero-btn inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange px-8 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-soft hover:opacity-90">
          Contact
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Development -->
  <section id="development" class="bg-slate-50" data-animate="fadeUp" data-delay="150">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-14 sm:py-20">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center" data-animate="fadeUp">
        <span class="mb-4 inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-orange" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-navy sm:text-4xl">Development</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-grayish sm:text-base">現場で使うためのアプリケーションと、Webの仕組みをつくっています。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2" data-animate="staggerChildren" data-stagger="100" data-delay="200">
        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-soft" data-animate-child>
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-orange">APP DEVELOPMENT</p>
              <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-navy">AYP Print Queue</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-orange/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-orange">開発中</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Excel・PDFファイルをWindowsのプリンターへ送信する、ローカル専用の印刷キューアプリ。業務の小さな手間を減らすためのスタンドアローンツールです。</p>
          <ul class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-medium text-slate-600" aria-label="使用技術">
            <li class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1">.NET 8</li>
            <li class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1">WinUI 3</li>
            <li class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1">Windows</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://github.com/nsh1l/print-queue-app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-navy underline decoration-orange decoration-2 underline-offset-4 hover:text-orange">
            GitHubで見る <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-soft" data-animate-child>
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-orange">WEB DEVELOPMENT</p>
              <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-navy">Parcel Tracking</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-green-500/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-green-700">Web App</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">配送番号から配送業者を判定し、追跡ページへすばやくアクセスできるWebアプリ。入力の検証、履歴保存、モバイルでの使いやすさまで設計しています。</p>
          <ul class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-medium text-slate-600" aria-label="使用技術">
            <li class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1">HTML</li>
            <li class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1">CSS</li>
            <li class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1">JavaScript</li>
            <li class="rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1">Cloudflare Workers</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://github.com/nsh1l/parcel-tracking" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-navy underline decoration-orange decoration-2 underline-offset-4 hover:text-orange">
            GitHubで見る <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Discography -->
  {% set on_am = discography.releases | selectattr("apple_music") | list %}
  {% set off_am = discography.releases | rejectattr("apple_music") | list %}

  <section id="discography" class="bg-white" data-animate="fadeUp" data-delay="150">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-14 sm:py-20">
      <div class="text-center mb-12" data-animate="fadeUp">
        <span class="inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-green-500 mb-4" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-navy">Discography</h2>
      </div>

      <!-- Main grid -->
      <div class="grid gap-1 grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3" data-animate="staggerChildren" data-stagger="80" data-delay="200">
        {% for release in on_am %}
          <div class="disc-card rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-100 bg-white shadow-soft" data-animate-child>
            {% if release.image %}
              <div class="aspect-square overflow-hidden bg-slate-100">
                <img src="{{ release.image }}" alt="{{ release.title }}" loading="lazy"
                     class="h-full w-full object-cover" />
              </div>
            {% else %}
              <div class="aspect-square bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-100 to-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
                <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-400 text-center">{{ release.title }}</p>
              </div>
            {% endif %}
            <div class="p-1 flex justify-center gap-2">
              {% if release.bandcamp %}
                <a href="{{ release.bandcamp }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                   class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-700 hover:bg-purple-500/20"
                   aria-label="Bandcamp">
                  <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M0 18.75l7.437-13.5H24l-7.438 13.5H0z"/></svg>
                </a>
              {% endif %}
              {% if release.spotify %}
                <a href="{{ release.spotify }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                   class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-500/10 text-green-700 hover:bg-green-500/20"
                   aria-label="Spotify">
                  <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 0C5.4 0 0 5.4 0 12s5.4 12 12 12 12-5.4 12-12S18.66 0 12 0zm5.521 17.34c-.24.359-.66.48-1.021.24-2.82-1.74-6.36-2.101-10.561-1.141-.418.122-.779-.179-.899-.539-.12-.421.18-.78.54-.9 4.56-1.021 8.52-.6 11.64 1.32.42.18.479.659.301 1.02zm1.44-3.3c-.301.42-.841.6-1.262.3-3.239-1.98-8.159-2.58-11.939-1.38-.479.12-1.02-.12-1.14-.6-.12-.48.12-1.021.6-1.141C9.6 9.9 15 10.561 18.72 12.84c.361.181.54.78.241 1.2zm.12-3.36C15.24 8.4 8.82 7.8 5.16 9.06c-.6.18-1.2-.18-1.38-.72-.18-.601.18-1.2.72-1.381 4.26-1.38 11.28-.66 15.36 1.56.54.3.72 1.02.42 1.56-.3.421-1.02.601-1.56.301z"/></svg>
                </a>
              {% endif %}
              {% if release.apple_music %}
                <a href="{{ release.apple_music }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                   class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-700 hover:bg-blue-500/20"
                   aria-label="Apple Music">
                  <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M17.05 20.28c-.98.95-2.05.8-3.08.35-1.09-.46-2.09-.48-3.24 0-1.44.62-2.2.44-3.06-.35C2.79 15.25 3.51 7.59 9.05 7.31c1.35.07 2.29.74 3.08.8 1.18-.24 2.31-.93 3.57-.84 1.51.12 2.65.72 3.4 1.8-3.12 1.87-2.38 5.98.48 7.13-.57 1.5-1.31 2.99-2.54 4.09zM12.03 7.25c-.15-2.23 1.66-4.07 3.74-4.25.29 2.58-2.34 4.5-3.74 4.25z"/></svg>
                </a>
              {% endif %}
              {% if release.youtube_music %}
                <a href="{{ release.youtube_music }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                   class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-red-500/10 text-red-700 hover:bg-red-500/20"
                   aria-label="YouTube">
                  <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M23.498 6.186a3.016 3.016 0 0 0-2.122-2.136C19.505 3.545 12 3.545 12 3.545s-7.505 0-9.377.505A3.017 3.017 0 0 0 .502 6.186C0 8.07 0 12 0 12s0 3.93.502 5.814a3.016 3.016 0 0 0 2.122 2.136c1.871.505 9.376.505 9.376.505s7.505 0 9.377-.505a3.015 3.015 0 0 0 2.122-2.136C24 15.93 24 12 24 12s0-3.93-.502-5.814zM9.545 15.568V8.432L15.818 12l-6.273 3.568z"/></svg>
                </a>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <!-- Other releases -->
      {% if off_am | length > 0 %}
        <div class="mt-10 text-center">
          <details class="group inline-block text-left">
            <summary class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer rounded-full border border-slate-300 bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-navy hover:bg-slate-50 list-none">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-open:rotate-90" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7.21 14.77a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06L11.168 10 7.23 6.29a.75.75 0 111.04-1.08l4.5 4.25a.75.75 0 010 1.08l-4.5 4.25a.75.75 0 01-1.06-.02z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
              </svg>
              Other（{{ off_am | length }}）
            </summary>
            <div class="mt-6 grid gap-1 grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3">
              {% for release in off_am %}
                <div class="disc-card rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-100 bg-white shadow-soft" data-animate-child>
                  {% if release.image %}
                    <div class="aspect-square overflow-hidden bg-slate-100">
                      <img src="{{ release.image }}" alt="{{ release.title }}" loading="lazy"
                           class="h-full w-full object-cover" />
                    </div>
                  {% else %}
                    <div class="aspect-square bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-100 to-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
                      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-400 text-center">{{ release.title }}</p>
                    </div>
                  {% endif %}
                  <div class="p-3 flex justify-center gap-2">
                    {% if release.bandcamp %}
                      <a href="{{ release.bandcamp }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                         class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-700 hover:bg-purple-500/20"
                         aria-label="Bandcamp">
                        <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M0 18.75l7.437-13.5H24l-7.438 13.5H0z"/></svg>
                      </a>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if release.youtube_music %}
                      <a href="{{ release.youtube_music }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                         class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-red-500/10 text-red-700 hover:bg-red-500/20"
                         aria-label="YouTube">
                        <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M23.498 6.186a3.016 3.016 0 0 0-2.122-2.136C19.505 3.545 12 3.545 12 3.545s-7.505 0-9.377.505A3.017 3.017 0 0 0 .502 6.186C0 8.07 0 12 0 12s0 3.93.502 5.814a3.016 3.016 0 0 0 2.122 2.136c1.871.505 9.376.505 9.376.505s7.505 0 9.377-.505a3.015 3.015 0 0 0 2.122-2.136C24 15.93 24 12 24 12s0-3.93-.502-5.814zM9.545 15.568V8.432L15.818 12l-6.273 3.568z"/></svg>
                      </a>
                    {% endif %}
                  </div>
                </div>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      <div class="text-center mt-10">
        <a href="https://so1loh.bandcamp.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
           class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-green-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-green-700">
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M0 18.75l7.437-13.5H24l-7.438 13.5H0z"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-slate-50" data-animate="fadeUp" data-delay="100">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-navy mb-6">Contact</h2>
      <a href="mailto:yo@alwaysyesterday.party"
         class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange px-8 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-soft hover:opacity-90">
        Contact
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
